&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;margin-top:2.5pt;margin-bottom:2.5pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;東京証券取引所市場第一部へ指定替え。&lt;/p&gt;
